# Sovereign RE Dashboard — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values. Docker reads it each time the
# containers start (`docker compose up -d`); no rebuild needed after an edit.

# Dashboard password. Blank = no login, which is only safe while the dashboard
# is reachable from this computer alone (docker-compose.yml binds it to
# 127.0.0.1). Set one before opening it to your network or the internet.
# Use at least 12 characters (a few unrelated words); a shorter one shows a
# warning after login. Open it from other devices through Tailscale (README),
# not an open port: Tailscale adds HTTPS and lets only your devices in.
DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=
# Minutes without activity before the password is asked again (0 = never).
SESSION_IDLE_MINUTES=60

# Telegram alerts (modules/alerts.py): after each full run, one message with
# new deals, price cuts on the deals you track, and failed runs. Both blank =
# no alerts. The token comes from @BotFather; to find your chat id, message
# your bot, then run `python -m modules.alerts chat-id` (README "Telegram
# alerts"). The token lets anyone post as your bot: keep it here only.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
# What a deal must be for a message, until you save your own rules in the
# dashboard's ALERTS tab (they replace these): its class; optionally its grade
# and the least monthly surplus (€, under the recommended structure — may be
# negative: -150 = it may cost up to €150 a month). ALERT_FAILURES=0 turns off
# the failed-run and quiet-portal alerts.
# ALERT_CLASSES=GREEN,YELLOW
# ALERT_GRADES=A,B
# ALERT_MIN_SURPLUS=-150
# ALERT_FAILURES=1

# Storage is SQLite (data/sovereign.db) — no database settings needed. Older
# copies of this file set DATABASE_URL to a Postgres server; it is now ignored.

# Google Places API (for Location IQ + Satellite Viewer)
# Get at: console.cloud.google.com → Enable Places API + Geocoding API
# Free $200/month credit — sufficient for personal use
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# Slovak cadastre (LV debt checking) needs NO key: ÚGKK SR has no public API,
# so kataster_scraper.py scrapes kataster.skgeodesy.sk directly.

# ScraperAPI — REQUIRED if running on a cloud/server IP that is blocked by real estate sites
# Free tier: 5,000 requests/month — enough for daily scraping
# Sign up free at: https://www.scraperapi.com
# Without this key the scrapers make direct requests (works on home/residential internet)
SCRAPER_API_KEY=

# Anthropic Claude API (optional — cloud LLM for listing enrichment)
# Used to parse Slovak free-text descriptions, fix blank districts, and run
# structured LV title-deed analysis. Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com
# Leave blank to disable (enrichment helpers no-op gracefully without it).
#
# SECURITY: put the real key in your local .env ONLY. .env is gitignored, so the
# secret never enters the repo. Never paste a live key into this .env.example,
# into source files, or into chat — rotate immediately if a key is exposed.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# One model per task (ANTHROPIC_MODEL is no longer read):
#   bulk = description parsing + address normalisation, every new listing
#   LV   = the title-deed read, which can reject a flat or clear a lien
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL_BULK=claude-haiku-5-5
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL_LV=claude-opus-5-5

# How many residential properties you already own. At 2+, your next purchase
# is a 3rd+ property and NBS caps the loan at 70% LTV (from 1 Oct 2026), so
# scoring uses 70% instead of 80%.
PROPERTIES_OWNED=0

# Your yearly personal tax base from everything else (salary after your own
# contributions, other income), in EUR. The rental is taxed on top of it, at
# the bands it lands in (19 / 25 / 30 / 35 % from 2026). 0 = the rental is
# your only income, which understates its tax if you work. Czechia, in Kč:
# CZ_OTHER_ANNUAL_INCOME.
OTHER_ANNUAL_INCOME=0
# 1 deducts the mortgage interest from the personal (§ 6 ods. 3) rental tax
# base. Slovak guidance allows it as a provable expense, but confirm it with
# your účtovník first; then ♻️ RESCORE ALL. 0 (the default) leaves it out,
# which overstates the personal tax and so favours the s.r.o.
# PERSONAL_INTEREST_DEDUCTIBLE=0
# Your bank's offer (the dashboard's 👤 YOUR SITUATION panel sets these too,
# and what it saves outranks this file). Then ♻️ RESCORE ALL.
# MORTGAGE_RATE_PA=0.038
# LOAN_TERM_YEARS=25
# LTV_RATIO=0.80

# OpenStreetMap (no key needed). Location IQ uses Nominatim to geocode when no
# Google key is set; its usage policy asks for a contact email.
NOMINATIM_EMAIL=
# Optional overrides for the open-data endpoints (modules/risk_data.py).
# OVERPASS_URL=https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter
# FLOOD_IDENTIFY_URL=https://mpt.svp.sk/server/rest/services/MPOMPR_II/Op_Ohrozenie_Q/MapServer/identify
# FLOOD_LAYER_IDS=24

# Daily backups (backups/ in this folder): how many of each kind to keep.
# BACKUP_KEEP=14

# ── Modelling settings (all optional; defaults in config.py) ─────────────────
# What an s.r.o. costs every year it exists (bookkeeping, annual accounts,
# registered office, bank fees) — use your účtovník's quote.
# SRO_ANNUAL_RUNNING_COST=1200
# A company borrows on commercial terms: the s.r.o. scenario uses the mortgage
# rate + this premium (0.01 = 1 pp) and at most this LTV. Use a bank's quote.
# SRO_RATE_PREMIUM_PP=0.01
# SRO_LTV_RATIO=0.70
# 0 leaves out the flat's depreciation (40 years, up to its rent) from the
# s.r.o.'s taxable profit. Confirm with your účtovník.
# SRO_DEPRECIATION=1
# Monthly surplus (€) below which a listing is flagged cash-flow negative.
# CASHFLOW_MIN_SURPLUS=0

# Title-deed texts (owners, addresses, creditors) are deleted after this many
# days: cached cadastre reads, and the LV texts of listings off the market that
# long (a deal you still track keeps its own). Verdicts and reasons stay.
# 0 keeps them for ever.
# LV_TEXT_RETENTION_DAYS=180
# A clean LV is read again from the cadastre after this many days, and weekly
# for a deal you have in OFFER or later. 0 never re-reads.
# LV_PASS_RECHECK_DAYS=30
# LV_PASS_RECHECK_DEAL_DAYS=7
# € figures below this on a listing page are deposits/fees, never the price.
# SALE_PRICE_MIN_EUR=15000
# Tax year to score with (defaults to the calendar year; see TAX_YEAR_RULES).
# TAX_YEAR=2026
# Reject utility/access easements and a municipality's pre-emption right too
# (by default they are shown as soft flags, not rejected).
# LV_SOFT_FLAGS_REJECT=0

# ── Czech market (markets.py; all optional) ──────────────────────────────────
# One EUR→CZK rate for the combined view and the EUR price filter (a Czech
# listing keeps its own crowns everywhere else). Leave these unset: the ČNB
# daily rate is fetched automatically (modules/fx_rate.py). Setting
# CZK_PER_EUR pins the rate by hand instead — label it with its date.
# CZK_PER_EUR=24.355
# FX_RATE_DATE=2026-10-14
# FX_RATE_SOURCE=ČNB kurzy devizového trhu
#
# ČÚZK API KN — a free key (registrace.cuzk.gov.cz, "API dat katastru
# nemovitostí") lets the Czech LV check find the building under a listing's
# map pin, its LV and pending proceedings. It never reads an LV's contents:
# paste the flat's výpis z LV on its card for that. Same secrecy as above.
CZ_CUZK_API_KEY=
# A pasted výpis older than this many days never clears a title (default 30).
# CZ_LV_MAX_VYPIS_AGE_DAYS=30
# CZ_CUZK_API_BASE=https://api-kn.cuzk.gov.cz
# CZ_RUIAN_MAPSERVER=https://ags.cuzk.gov.cz/arcgis/rest/services/RUIAN/MapServer
# CZ_RUIAN_ADDRESS_LAYER=1
# Czech flood areas (ÚÚR / VÚV) and the 2022 strategic noise map (MZ ČR).
# CZ_FLOOD_IDENTIFY_URL=https://egis.uur.cz/arcgis/rest/services/UAP/UAP_CR/MapServer/identify
# CZ_FLOOD_LAYER_IDS=82
# CZ_NOISE_IDENTIFY_URL=https://geoportal.mzcr.cz/server/rest/services/SHM2022/Silnice_Ldvn/ImageServer/identify
#
# Czech lending and costs. The defaults are published figures or the middle
# of published price lists (docs/M1_VERIFICATION.md) — your own building's
# předpis záloh, bank's and účetní's quotes beat them.
# CZ_MORTGAGE_RATE_PA=0.0551
# CZ_SVJ_FOND_OPRAV_PER_M2=20
# CZ_SVJ_SPRAVA_PER_UNIT=200
# Purchase costs: a fixed sum (2 vklad filings + advokát contract and úschova
# + valuation) plus a share of the price — set the share for a notářská úschova.
# CZ_ACQUISITION_COST_FIXED=19000
# CZ_ACQUISITION_COST_RATE=0
# Local coefficient for a Czech municipality under 10,000 people (Prague, the
# statutory cities and the towns over 10,000 are read from their 2026
# ordinances; every municipality's size coefficient from its population).
# CZ_PROPERTY_TAX_LOCAL_COEF=1.0
# CZ_SRO_SETUP_COST=4000
# CZ_SRO_ANNUAL_RUNNING_COST=20000
# The s.r.o. loan terms are still the Slovak profile's (UNVERIFIED for Czechia).
# CZ_SRO_RATE_PREMIUM_PP=0.01
# CZ_SRO_LTV_RATIO=0.70
# CZ_CASHFLOW_MIN_SURPLUS=0
# CZ_SALE_PRICE_MIN=200000
# Hold-period assumptions: growth rates are the Slovak ones unless set; exit
# costs default to 4 % (agent ~3 % + DPH, and legal fees).
# CZ_APPRECIATION_RATE=
# CZ_RENT_GROWTH_RATE=
# CZ_COST_INFLATION_RATE=
# CZ_EXIT_COST_RATE=0.04

# ── Added 17 Nov 2026 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# E-mail when the daily run is late or fails (healthchecks.io, free): the
# check's ping URL, https://hc-ping.com/<uuid>. README "Is the daily run happening?"
HEALTHCHECK_URL=
# The Czech average mortgage rate from ČNB ARAD (free account at cnb.cz/arad;
# the key is in your profile; the indicator id from ARAD's detail of the
# series "new business, loans to households for house purchase").
CZ_ARAD_API_KEY=
CZ_ARAD_RATE_INDICATOR=
# Slovak real-estate auctions from the notaries' register after each daily
# run (0 turns it off).
AUCTIONS_SOURCE=1
# 1: the automated tax-rate runs also send scanned ordinances to Claude (a few
# cents a page; uploads are always read).
TAX_SCANS_WITH_CLAUDE=0
# Travel times on the map: openrouteservice (free key) for walking and
# driving — without it the public OSRM servers; Google Routes API for public
# transport.
ORS_API_KEY=
# Mapy.com geocoder (Seznam): finds a Czech address to the house number
# (from the state register of addresses, RUIAN) and a Slovak one too. Free key:
# developer.mapy.com → My account → API keys. Tried first for Czech listings,
# after Google for Slovak ones; OpenStreetMap stays the last resort. Its terms
# ask for a "Search by Mapy.com" credit: the page footer shows one.
MAPY_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_ROUTES_API_KEY=
# Short-let assumptions per area (TATRY, LIPTOV, BA1, PRAHA1, PRAHA2): the
# nightly rate in the market's currency and the share of nights booked.
# SHORT_LET_BA1_ADR=85
# SHORT_LET_BA1_OCCUPANCY=0.62

# Copy each new backup off this disk, to a synced or external folder. On a Mac,
# iCloud Drive is ~/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Sovereign-backups
# (keep it private: the backups hold title-deed texts with owners' names).
BACKUP_COPY_DIR=

# Who runs the dashboard — shown in the imprint under every page (Imprint ·
# Privacy · Terms) and the login page. Required before anyone else uses it
# (Slovak e-commerce act 22/2004 § 4; GDPR Art. 13). OPERATOR_VAT_ID and
# OPERATOR_PHONE only if they apply.
OPERATOR_NAME=
OPERATOR_ADDRESS=
OPERATOR_ID=
OPERATOR_VAT_ID=
OPERATOR_REGISTER=
OPERATOR_EMAIL=
OPERATOR_PHONE=
